# Local MCP server configuration. NEVER COMMITTED, and this repository is
# PUBLIC: a project-scoped .mcp.json names the infrastructure a session can
# reach (on 2026-09-22 it pointed at the sandbox product's PRODUCTION Supabase
# project). None of that is a credential -- the project ref is already visible
# to any browser using the app -- but publishing a map of what a developer
# machine can connect to is free reconnaissance and belongs in nobody's clone.
# Keep the file local; add servers with `claude mcp add` per checkout.
.mcp.json
